    "detailed_description": "<h1>Add Horribunnies to your wishlist!</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1187990/extras/3b7055ea55d7820555fb39453b36f2df.poster.avif?t=1726595225\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1187990/extras/3b7055ea55d7820555fb39453b36f2df.webm?t=1726595225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1187990/extras/3b7055ea55d7820555fb39453b36f2df.mp4?t=1726595225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1187990/extras/5ac74680e5a44d978a49d2b1121eb458.avif?t=1726595225\" /></div><br><br><i>Hewwo, I'm P\u00e2querette! \u2282(\u25c9\u203f\u25c9\u273f)\u3064<br>I will be your guide in Horribunnies, teaching you how to take the UTMOST care of your bunnies so they'll all be super happy (and you too!) :3<br>Our bunnies need to be fed, groomed, petted, and cleaned D-A-I-L-Y, but most importantly... they need to be loved! (\u706c\u2665\u03c9\u2665\u706c)<br>I will be watching you practice on my own bun-bun, Moko, before I leave you in charge of the store's hutches \u2013 no pressure, I swear! :p</i><br><br><strong>Add to your wishlist now to stay updated on these buns' development!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1187990/extras/b578c11cef749caba1d26ad1d4a918d5.avif?t=1726595225\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Bond with the cutest virtual bunnies you've ever seen.</strong> They come in all shapes and sizes but require the same amount of petting!<br></li><li><strong>Get food, equipment, and cosmetics for your buns</strong> so they'll be as happy as bunnily possible!!<br></li><li>Everything is as flashy and sweet as it gets, from <strong>lovely graphics</strong> to <strong>sugary music</strong>... You're guaranteed to melt with joy!</li></ul><br><i>Hoy, Oph\u00e9line here (\u2310\u25a1_\u25a1)<br>There are lots of other things you can do to make your bunnies as profitable \u201cas bunnily possible\u201d... (\uffe2\u203f\uffe2 )</i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Put up some of your bunnies for adoption</strong> so you can focus more on your favorites.<br></li><li><strong>Traits are inherited genetically, so breed responsibly!</strong> You don\u2019t want cheap-looking bunnies, do you?<br></li><li><strong>Genetically engineer your bunnies</strong> to boost their value: If you figure out how their genes work, you can land a killer bun!<br></li><li><strong>Take an alternative approach</strong>: My methods may not be to P\u00e2querette\u2019s taste, but if you stick with me, we will definitely change this pet shop.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1187990/extras/5ac74680e5a44d978a49d2b1121eb458.avif?t=1726595225\" /></div><br><br><i>Hewwo, I'm P\u00e2querette! \u2282(\u25c9\u203f\u25c9\u273f)\u3064<br>I will be your guide in Horribunnies, teaching you how to take the UTMOST care of your bunnies so they'll all be super happy (and you too!) :3<br>Our bunnies need to be fed, groomed, petted, and cleaned D-A-I-L-Y, but most importantly... they need to be loved! (\u706c\u2665\u03c9\u2665\u706c)<br>I will be watching you practice on my own bun-bun, Moko, before I leave you in charge of the store's hutches \u2013 no pressure, I swear! :p</i><br><br><strong>Add to your wishlist now to stay updated on these buns' development!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1187990/extras/b578c11cef749caba1d26ad1d4a918d5.avif?t=1726595225\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Bond with the cutest virtual bunnies you've ever seen.</strong> They come in all shapes and sizes but require the same amount of petting!<br></li><li><strong>Get food, equipment, and cosmetics for your buns</strong> so they'll be as happy as bunnily possible!!<br></li><li>Everything is as flashy and sweet as it gets, from <strong>lovely graphics</strong> to <strong>sugary music</strong>... You're guaranteed to melt with joy!</li></ul><br><i>Hoy, Oph\u00e9line here (\u2310\u25a1_\u25a1)<br>There are lots of other things you can do to make your bunnies as profitable \u201cas bunnily possible\u201d... (\uffe2\u203f\uffe2 )</i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Put up some of your bunnies for adoption</strong> so you can focus more on your favorites.<br></li><li><strong>Traits are inherited genetically, so breed responsibly!</strong> You don\u2019t want cheap-looking bunnies, do you?<br></li><li><strong>Genetically engineer your bunnies</strong> to boost their value: If you figure out how their genes work, you can land a killer bun!<br></li><li><strong>Take an alternative approach</strong>: My methods may not be to P\u00e2querette\u2019s taste, but if you stick with me, we will definitely change this pet shop.</li></ul>",
